Source: lintunes
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake, pkg-config, g++, libgtk-3-dev,
 libgstreamer1.0-dev, libgstreamer-plugins-base1.0-dev, libtag1-dev,
 libsqlite3-dev, libgpod-dev, libcdio-dev, libcdio-paranoia-dev,
 libcddb2-dev, libvlc-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: @HOMEPAGE@

Package: lintunes
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, gstreamer1.0-plugins-base,
 gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, vlc-plugin-base, udisks2, dosfstools
Recommends: gstreamer1.0-libav, flac, lame, vorbis-tools, ffmpeg, wodim
Suggests: idevicerestore, libimobiledevice-utils
Description: GTK music library manager with iPod synchronization
 LinTunes provides GStreamer audio playback, libVLC internet radio,
 playlists, CD ripping and burning, and Windows/FAT iPod synchronization.
 Supported iPods can be formatted as FAT32 after explicit erase consent.
